# server identifier, host name, client FQDN (RFC 4702, flags 0, name WS-11 in ASCII),
# vendor class MSFT 5.0 and the Windows parameter request list; already 308 octets, so not
# padded. Modelled by hand on the option order and parameter request list this client
# sends; documentation addresses (RFC 5737) and MACs (RFC 7042).
#
# op 1, htype 1, hlen 6, hops 1
01 01 06 01
# xid
a1 01 11 02
# secs, flags
00 00 00 00
